Subject: [PATCH] renetcode: test decoder, client and token input validation
 (R1, D1, D4-D6)

Regression tests for R1, D1, D4, D5 and D6,
plus a deterministic, std-only corpus of encoded, truncated, corrupted and
adversarial datagrams. The corpus checks that `Packet::decode` and the client
receive path return an error without panicking and only consume replay
sequences for authenticated packets. The packet and token test helpers are
`pub(crate)` so the server tests can share them.
